    "This pulls the latest Hermes server version and restarts it. Active chats may be interrupted briefly; the app reconnects when the server is back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "这会拉取最新的 Hermes 服务器版本并将其重启。进行中的聊天可能会短暂中断；服务器恢复后应用会重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the scheduled task from the Hermes server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "这会从 Hermes 服务器移除该计划任务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the server and its saved settings on this device. Your active server is unaffected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "这会移除此设备上的该服务器及其已保存的设置。你的当前服务器不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the session from the Hermes server. Use this only on a session you no longer need.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "这会从 Hermes 服务器移除该会话。请仅对你不再需要的会话执行此操作。"
